 * 🛡️ MASTER MICROKERNEL ARCHITECTURE LINKER SCRIPT
 * Enforces strict 4KB section boundaries for Write XOR Execute (W^X) compatibility
 * ============================================================================== */

OUTPUT_FORMAT("pe-x86-64")
ENTRY(kmain)

