 * @WOWLAN_MLO_GTK_FLAG_LINK_ID_MSK: spec link id of the key
 * @WOWLAN_MLO_GTK_FLAG_KEY_TYPE_MSK: &enum iwl_wowlan_mlo_gtk_type
